  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country portfolio budget - CPB Congo, Democratic Republic 2027-2030 Provide integrated and coordinated emergency food and nutrition assistance to food-insecure individuals and households at risk of and affected by crises or shocks, as well as school-aged children and adolescent boys and girls, while strengthening anticipatory action, and community-based capacity for emergency preparedness and early recovery capacities.</narrative>
